<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Comparison</strong></div>
    <div>noun + adjective + <strong>gwo</strong> + noun</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">呢個車大<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">過</span>嗰個車</div>
    <div>nī-go chē daaiℏ gwo gó-go chē</div>
    <div>This car is bigger than that car</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Negative comparison</strong></div>
    <div>noun + <strong>móuℏ</strong> + noun + <strong>gam</strong> + adjective</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">汽車<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">冇</span>飛機<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">咁</span>快</div>
    <div>hei-chè móuℏ fèi-gèi gam faai</div>
    <div>Cars aren't as fast as planes</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Simple comparison</strong></div>
    <div>adjective + <strong>dī</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">呢個車大<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">啲</span></div>
    <div>nī-go chē daaiℏ dī</div>
    <div>This car is bigger</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Simple comparison</strong></div>
    <div><strong>juℏng</strong> + adjective</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">呢個車<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">重</span>大</div>
    <div>nī-go chē juℏng daaiℏ</div>
    <div>This car is even bigger</div>
</div>
